Eigen 3.4.0
-----------
The _core extension compiles Eigen 3.4.0 headers. Eigen's COPYING.README says
Eigen is primarily MPL-2.0 and that some files contain third-party code under
BSD or LGPL licenses. This wheel reproduces the Eigen 3.4.0 texts. They are
members of *.dist-info/licenses/, at:

- _staged_core/vendor/Eigen/COPYING.MPL2
- _staged_core/vendor/Eigen/COPYING.BSD
- _staged_core/vendor/Eigen/COPYING.APACHE
- _staged_core/vendor/Eigen/COPYING.LGPL
- _staged_core/vendor/Eigen/COPYING.README

The same bytes are in the source distribution at _staged_core/vendor/Eigen/.

Source availability for the executable form (MPL 2.0 section 3.2): the Source
Code Form of the Eigen files compiled into this wheel is that
_staged_core/vendor/Eigen tree in the pyfylr source distribution of the same
version. Those files were taken from the Eigen 3.4.0 release. A recipient of
this wheel can obtain that source from the matching pyfylr source
distribution, or from the upstream Eigen 3.4.0 archive:

https://gitlab.com/libeigen/eigen/-/archive/3.4.0/eigen-3.4.0.tar.bz2

The tag page is https://gitlab.com/libeigen/eigen/-/tags/3.4.0.

Parts that are not MPL-2.0 alone:

- Intel Corporation, 2011, BSD-3-Clause, on the MKL/LAPACKE binding headers.
  The text is COPYING.BSD.
- Willow Garage, Inc. (2011-2014) and Open Source Robotics Foundation
  (2014-2015), BSD-3-Clause, on AlignedBox::transform.
- TensorFlow Authors, 2017, Apache-2.0, on BFloat16.h. The Apache-2.0 text
  is COPYING.APACHE.
- Intel Corporation, 2001, permissive notice on the 4x4 inverse in
  InverseSize4.h. The header keeps that notice.
- IncompleteLUT.h is MPL-2.0. Its header says the implementation is derived
  from the LGPL SPARSKIT ILUT and that Yousef Saad permitted relicensing that
  implementation to MPL2 (Eigen mailing list, 8 July 2012). COPYING.LGPL is
  the upstream LGPL 2.1 text, retained unchanged because COPYING.README names
  it. It is not a claim that IncompleteLUT.h remains LGPL.

Four Eigen headers have no license header of their own:
src/Core/arch/HIP/hcc/math_constants.h, src/misc/blas.h, src/misc/lapack.h,
and src/misc/lapacke_mangling.h. They are shipped as part of Eigen 3.4.0 and
are covered by the COPYING files above.

